","You are visitor, no permission","你是訪客，暫無權限"],feedback:["投诉与反馈","Complaints and Feedback","投訴與反饋"],message:["留言","Leave a message","留言"],transferToPC:["在电脑端查看","Transfer to PC","在電腦端查看"],scanHistory:["我扫过的码","Scanned codes","我掃過的碼"],goWorkbench:["进入工作台","Enter workbench","進入工作臺"],goHomepage:["前往小程序首页","Go to homepage","前往小程序首頁"],miniProgramHomepage:["草料小程序首页","CaoLiao Mini Program","草料小程序首頁"],adminOnly:["仅管理员可见","Admin only","僅管理員可見"],reportViolation:["举报违规内容","Report violation","舉報違規內容"],moreOperation:["更多操作","More operation","更多操作"],reports:{statement:["我们是二维码在线服务平台，所有二维码内容由我们平台的用户自行制作。","We are a QR code online service platform, and all QR code content is produced by the users of our platform.","我們是二維碼在線服務平台，所有二維碼內容由我們平台的用户自行製作。"],StatementOfViolation:["如果二维码包含违法违规内容，我们将在核实后对该违规二维码进行封停，限制访问等操作。","If the QR code contains illegal content, we will block and restrict access to the illegal QR code after verification.","如果二維碼包含違法違規內容，我們將在核實後對該違規二維碼進行封停，限制訪問等操作。"],reportReason:["请选择举报原因","Please select the reason for report","請選擇舉報原因"],submitSuccessfully:["提交成功","submit successfully","提交成功"],dealSoon:["我们会尽快核实并处理","We will check and deal with it as soon as possible","我們會盡快核實並處理"],removeComplaints:["如何去除投诉入口","How to remove the complaints portal","如何去除投訴入口"],thanksSupport:["感谢您的支持！","Thanks for your support!","感謝您的支持！"],Back2QR:["返回二维码","Back to QR code","返回二維碼"],back:["返回","Back","返回"],qualityComplaints:["商品质量等相关投诉说明","Product quality and other related complaints","商品質量等相關投訴説明"],cliImInfo:["草料二维码是什么","What is cli.im?","草料二維碼是什麼"],WhoMadeTheQR:["二维码是谁做的","Who made the QR code?","二維碼是誰做的"],cliImInfoStatement:["草料二维码是一个二维码制作工具，免费提供二维码生成与管理功能。","cli.im is a QR code making tool that provides free QR code generation and management functions.","草料二維碼是一個二維碼製作工具，免費提供二維碼生成與管理功能。"],WhoMadeDes:["二维码由商家自行制作。商家会上传图片、文字等内容，生成二维码。通常是为了展示商品信息、做电子说明书等用途。","The QR code is made by the merchant. The merchant will upload pictures, text and other content to generate the QR code. Usually it is used to display product information, make electronic manuals and other purposes.","二維碼由商家自行製作。商家會上傳圖片、文字等內容，生成二維碼。通常是為了展示商品信息、做電子説明書等用途。"],afterSalesProblems:["我有售后问题怎么办","What should I do if I have after-sales problems?","我有售後問題怎麼辦"],afterSalesProblemsParagraph1:["商量质量或者售后问题，草料二维码无法解决，请您与商品生产方或销售方联系。","To discuss quality or after-sales problems, the QR code of forage cannot be solved. Please contact the manufacturer or seller of the product.","商量質量或者售後問題，草料二維碼無法解決，請您與商品生產方或銷售方聯繫。"],afterSalesProblemsParagraph2:["如有需要，您可以向有关部门进行投诉反馈，我们会配合有关部门提供必要信息。","If necessary, you can provide feedback to the relevant departments, and we will cooperate with them to provide the necessary information.","如有需要，您可以向有關部門進行投訴反饋，我們會配合有關部門提供必要信息。"],relevantDepartments:["有关部门联系方式","Contact information of relevant departments","有關部門聯繫方式"],ConsumerAssociationTel:["消费者协会电话：12315","Consumer Association Tel: 12315","消費者協會電話：12315"],National12315:["全国12315网站：","National 12315 website:","全國12315網站："],ImmediatelyCall:["立即拨打12315","Immediately Call 12315","立即撥打12315"],infringement:["如果有内容侵犯了您的合法权益：名称、商标被冒用，版权、隐私、肖像被侵犯等，可以按照我们的侵权投诉流程提交投诉，请在电脑上进行以下操作：","If there is any content that violates your legitimate rights and interests: names, trademarks are fraudulently used, copyrights, privacy, portraits are infringed, etc., you can submit a complaint according to our infringement complaint process. Please do the following on your computer:","如果有內容侵犯了您的合法權益：名稱、商標被冒用，版權、隱私、肖像被侵犯等，可以按照我們的侵權投訴流程提交投訴，請在電腦上進行以下操作："],open:["打开","Open","打開"],complaintEmail:[" 2.按照相应投诉流程发送投诉邮件","2. Send a complaint email according to the corresponding complaint process","2.按照相應投訴流程發送投訴郵件"],complaintDescription:["投诉描述","complaint description","投訴描述"],contactInformation:["请输入联系方式方便我们与你沟通了解情况","Please enter your contact information so that we can communicate with you to understand the situation.","請輸入聯繫方式方便我們與你溝通了解情況"],EvidenceScreenshot:["证据截图","Evidence screenshot","證據截圖"],SubmitFeedback:["提交反馈","Submit feedback","提交反饋"],PhoneNumber:["手机号","Phone number","手機號"],enterComplaint:["请输入投诉内容","Please enter the complaint content","請輸入投訴內容"],h5WhoMadeDes:["商品类二维码由厂家或销售方自行制作，我们仅是一个提供二维码相关服务的平台。","Commodity QR codes are produced by the manufacturer or seller, and we are only a platform that provides QR code related services.","商品類二維碼由廠家或銷售方自行製作，我們僅是一個提供二維碼相關服務的平台。"],contactMaker:["如果您希望联系制作者，可返回二维码查找联系方式；如果没有找到或沟通不成功，您可以向有关部门进行投诉反馈。","If you want to contact the producer, you can return to the QR code to find the contact information; if you can`t find it or the communication is unsuccessful, you can complain to the relevant departments for feedback.","如果您希望聯繫製作者，可返回二維碼查找聯繫方式；如果沒有找到或溝通不成功，您可以向有關部門進行投訴反饋。"],AssociationHotline:["消费者协会热线：","Consumer Association Hotline:","消費者協會熱線："],platform12315:["全国12315平台：","National 12315 platform:","全國12315平台："],uploadImgFail:["上传图片失败","Failed to upload image","上傳圖片失敗"],inputContact:["请输入联系方式方便我们与你沟通了解情况","Please enter your contact information so that we can communicate with you to understand the situation.","請輸入聯繫方式方便我們與你溝通了解情況"],selectComplaintRes:["请选择一个投诉原因","Please select a reason for your complaint","請選擇一個投訴原因"],describeComplaintContent:["请描述投诉内容","Please describe the content of the complaint","請描述投訴內容"]},rules:{locationDesc:["制码者已设置可访问地区范围","The creator has set the accessible area range","制碼者已設置可訪問地區範圍"],location:["当前位置无法查看","The QR code cannot be viewed at your current location","当前位置無法查看"],timeDesc:["制码者已设置可访问时间","The creator has set the accessible time","制碼者已設置可訪問時間"],time:["当前时间无法查看","The QR code cannot be viewed at this time","当前時間無法查看"],funcDescText:["功能说明","Function description","功能說明"],PermissionDescText:["权限说明","Permission description","权限说明"],reLocate:["重新定位","Relocate","重新定位"],passwordTitle:["该内容已被制作者加密","This content has been encrypted by the creator.","該內容已被制作者加密"],passwordReminder:["密码提示：","Password Hint：","密碼提示："],passwordPlaceholder:["请输入访问密码","Please enter the access password","請輸入訪問密碼"],autoEnter:["下次自动进入","Access automatically next time","