ogether with the record. Supports voice, images & text, @notifications, form filling, handwritten signatures, etc.","可在表單數據詳情頁進行協作和溝通，導出記錄時也會一併導出記錄的後續動態。支持語音、圖文、@通知、填寫表單、手寫簽名等。"],errModalTitlePrefix:["非常抱歉，该","Sorry, this ","非常抱歉，該"],errModalTitleSuffix:["由于技术原因无法正常展示"," cannot be displayed due to technical reasons","由於技術原因無法正常展示"],contactTechExpert:["联系技术专员处理","Contact technical support","聯繫技術專員處理"],reUpload:["重新上传","Re-upload","重新上傳"],techTeamDesc:["我们建立专门的技术服务团队，解决此问题，请点击下面按钮，联系我们处理。","We have set up a dedicated technical service team to resolve this issue. Please tap the button below to contact us.","我們建立專門的技術服務團隊，解決此問題，請點擊下面按鈕，聯繫我們處理。"],reuploadImportantPrefix:["如果","If the ","如果"],reuploadImportantSuffix:["内容很重要，请重新上传"," content is important, please re-upload","內容很重要，請重新上傳"],stillApprove:["仍要审批","Approve anyway","仍要審批"],upgradeVersion:["升级版本","Upgrade","升級版本"],buyBoost:["增购提升包","Buy add-on pack","增購提升包"],editReason:["修改原因","Reason for change","修改原因"],editVerifyResult:["修改校验结果","Edit verification result","修改校驗結果"],adminCanEditResult:["你是管理员，可修改结果","You are an admin and can edit the result","你是管理員，可修改結果"],aiResult:["AI结果","AI Result","AI結果"],quickInput:["快捷输入","Quick input","快捷輸入"],sendToWechatFriend:["发送给微信好友","Send to WeChat friend","發送給微信好友"],sendToWecomColleague:["发送给企业微信同事","Send to WeCom colleague","發送給企業微信同事"],seniorMemberPermission:["高级成员权限","Senior Member Permission","高級成員權限"],pullToRefreshContent:["下拉刷新内容","Pull down to refresh","下拉刷新內容"],refreshIdle:["下拉刷新","Pull down to refresh","下拉刷新"],refreshCanRefresh:["松手刷新，下拉分享二维码","Release to refresh, pull down to share QR code","鬆手刷新，下拉分享二維碼"],refreshRefreshing:["正在刷新","Refreshing","正在刷新"],refreshCompleted:["刷新成功","Refreshed","刷新成功"],refreshFailed:["刷新失败","Refresh failed","刷新失敗"],refreshCanTwoLevel:["松手分享二维码","Release to share QR code","鬆手分享二維碼"],maskViewableBy:["仅限本人和管理员能查看","Only the owner and admins can view the ","僅限本人和管理員能查看"],maskFullData:["完整数据","full data","完整數據"],maskFullNumber:["完整号码","full number","